Consolidation exercises
Module 3 exercises
The exercises are independent from the adventure and challenge. They are organized into four blocks:

recognize, count and compare categorical variables;
clean character strings and extract patterns;
clean and summarize a small fictitious service-request dataset;
produce readable categorical visualizations.

The series ends with two case studies using fictitious data different from the adventure data: 311 requests and public transit complaints.

Deliverables
Your GitHub repository must contain the following three files:

defi_04.qmd: your reproducible working document;
donnees_propres.csv: the cleaned dataset;
journal_nettoyage.Rdata: an R object containing the journal_nettoyage list.

Your .qmd file must render to HTML without error.

Minimum Requirements
