Questions to Answer
Your report must answer the following three questions.

Which time slots seem associated with the largest departure delays?
Are the available weather variables, such as wind_gust, visib or precip, associated with delays?
Are older planes more often delayed or cancelled?

For each question, include:

a short sentence explaining what you are comparing;
at least one table or numerical summary;
at least one visualization;
a concise interpretation;
one cautious sentence about the limits of the analysis.

