Expected Contract
Your IDUL.R file must define a function named exactly scrape_page().

scrape_page &lt;- function(url) {
  # Your code here
}

The function must respect the following contract:

it takes one argument, url, containing the address of a Données Québec search page or the path to a local HTML page used for tests;
